It’s one of the hardest reservations to get in Philly for a reason - Zahav has an unreal tasting menu that they gladly adapt to be gluten free! We were lucky to get a reservation this week for our anniversary and it was worth staying up past my bedtime for the chef’s tasting menu! Not only do they have great food, but they have really friendly staff who make sure you have the best experience! I’ll be back (that is, if I can get another reservation lol)
@zahavfoods 
#glutenfree #philly #restaurant #dinner

@zahavrestaurant truly blew me away…
Each course brought bold and fresh flavors that left everyone at the table wanting more! It was difficult to pick just one star of the show, from the freshly made hummus to the tehina mushrooms and crusted chicken, it was WELL worth the months of waiting to get a reservation. Micheal Solomonov is a culinary genius and his food goes to prove just that!

This may have been my first visit but I truly hope it’s not the last. Their rotational menu each month has me searching for a December reservation already 🤞🏻🤤

Great night at Zahav with friends. Finally got to meet Michael Solomon who’s taught me so much about Israeli cooking and getting back to my roots through his books Zahav and Israeli Soul.

Great human.

@mikesolomonov let’s hit Mt. Baker together one of these days 🏂.

